[{:db/id "q-162824/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23" :answer/id #uuid "92a17821-c36a-5b8d-9aa6-f4515f21dff6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162824/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "28b1398b-9d65-5e24-aef4-03a34162dc52" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162824/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "3fb06ec0-f69d-565a-b901-460d6ade6d9e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162824/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "4d3bff92-d7e6-5a44-ae56-e98325dbf010" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162824/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9" :answer/id #uuid "f403fd01-3620-505b-b5c4-db964c81d9f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the statements are true" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-162824/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bec03a4a-4d14-5cec-9215-cbaf2fa8f03f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-162824/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9" :answer-field/choices ["q-162824/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23" "q-162824/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-162824/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-162824/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-162824/selection/03b99debc8e9534f2364927a2cf1eba83bddd906503dea5d13395ce906a45ab9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-162824" :question/id #uuid "61217abd-1199-5f0c-bc56-23b219ed6d83" :question/math-academy-id "q-162824" :question/problem "| $f$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.35$ | $0.15$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.25$ | $0.25$ |\n\nThe joint probability distribution $f(x,y)$ of the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given above, while the marginal mass functions for these variables are shown below.\n\n| | $x$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.5$ | $0.5$ | |  | | $y$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.6$ | $0.4$ | |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.5$ | $0.5$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.6$ | $0.4$ |\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $P(X=1,Y=0)=P(X=1)\\cdot P(Y=0)$\n- $P(X=x,Y=y)=P(X=x)\\cdot P(Y=y)$ for all possible $x$ and $y$\n- $X$ and $Y$ are independent" :question/worked-solution "Two discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ with a joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ are independent if and only if \n\n$$\nf(x,y)={f}_{X}(x)\\cdot {f}_{Y}(y)\n$$\n\n \n\nfor all possible values $x$ and $y,$ where ${f}_{X}(x)$ and ${f}_{Y}(y)$ are the marginal probability mass functions for $X$ and $Y,$ respectively.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our statements.\n\n- Statements I and II are false. From the table, we obtain that $P(X=1,Y=0)=f(1,0)=0.25.$ However, \n\n$$\nP(X=1)\\cdot P(Y=0)={f}_{X}(1)\\cdot {f}_{Y}(0)=0.5\\cdot 0.6=0.3.\\,\\times \n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\nP(X=1,Y=0)\\ne P(X=1)\\cdot P(Y=0),\n$$\n\nand $P(X=x,Y=y)\\ne P(X=x)\\cdot P(Y=y)$ for all possible $x$ and $y.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since statement II is false, our random variables $X$ and $Y$ are *not* independent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the statements are true.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-162824/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "35de7257-8d35-5f81-89be-c7faa73d6bc3"] :knowle